Author: Kerson Segura <kersonseguraarias@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 22 10:34:47 2025 -0600

    Optimize bundle size for Vercel Lambda limits
    
    - Move large dependencies (canvas, jsdom, sqlite3, etc.) to devDependencies
    - Add conditional imports for scraping APIs to work in production
    - Configure Next.js webpack externals to exclude large packages from server bundle
    - Add .vercelignore to exclude unnecessary files from deployment
    - Disable Sentry source maps to reduce bundle size
    - Update Vercel configuration for better function management
    - Scraping APIs now return 503 in production (dev-only feature)
